# ---------------- TK4_Explosion.events (Task 16 Part C.5) ----------------
# `explode` spawns the scene's Explosion actor where the projectile stopped, and this block runs
# on that clone: the particle, half a second to play out, then the clone removes itself.
#
# Same `my spawnedFrom` gate as TK4_MuzzleFlash.events: the scene's template gets its sheet
# attached at startup even while inactive, so an ungated `destroy me` would delete the template
# before anything could clone it. Only a spawned copy reads this flag.

when me appears
  my spawnedFrom is "Explosion"
  print "TK4 explosion: clone appeared"
  play particle "explosion"
  wait 0.5 seconds
  print "TK4 explosion: clone done"
  destroy me
